# Play test of Netmender's Harbour (CIPlay netmenders_harbour): no quest - the quay, the piers, the net shed, the
# harbour master's cabin, the net canisters in their chests, the beached boat, the wreck, the den, the warthogs
island Netmender's Harbour
offset -4.4579 0.0448
expect animals Warthog 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 5
where BalboaCave
walk 24 -16 to 24 0 to 24 16 h=1.6
read Harbour sign
walk 20.25 -6 to 20.25 -4 to 20.25 -1.5 h=1.7
read The harbour master's book
open Harbour master's chest
expect item NetCanister 1
open Quay barrel
walk 31 9.5 to 40 9.5 to 47 9.5 to 50 10 h=1.8
open Net shed crate
expect item NetCanister 3
walk 31 -8.5 to 40 -8.5 to 47 -8.5 h=1.8
open Box by the beached boat
open Barrel by the wreck
expect item NetCanister 5
open Bear den hoard
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
